        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Concealed Overhead Door Closers</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Concealed LCN 3133 is designed to mount in 1 3/4\" thick interior doors. Its compact design fits into the top of the door for a very clean appearance. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/KABA-6200-specifications.gif?v=1704442280\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"LCN 3133 closer dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe double lever arm provides superior door control, for doors up to 38\" wide. This is a handed closer with a spring size 3 and Aluminum finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/3130.pdf?v=1704262218\" target=\"new\"><b>LCN 3133  Installation Instructions (PDF).</b></a>\r\n</P>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe LCN 3133 Concealed Overhead Door Closer is UL and ULC listed for self-closing doors and comes with a 15 year warranty. \r\nTested and certified under ANSI Standard A156.4, <b>Grade 1</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with door closer, mounting bracket, closer arm, track, roller and installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this door closer: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>",
